# Third-party tools kept locally for occasional use - not project source.
# Wildcarded so a future version bump (upx-4.0-win64/, bfg-1.15.0.jar) still matches.
upx*/
bfg*

# Editor/OS noise
.vscode/
*.log
*.exe
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Except third-party utility binaries this repo deliberately tracks (see README's Setup section).
!AHK Setup/*.exe
!AutoHotkey Companion Files/*.exe
*Dialog*

# Log output directories
Logs/
AllScripts/Logs/

# Claude Code's own local session/tool state - not project content.
.claude/

# --- Personal/machine-specific config -------------------------------------
# These 3 files carry this machine's real paths/credentials and must NEVER be
# tracked - each has a tracked `.example` counterpart with generic
# placeholders instead. See ARCHITECTURE.md's "Path-leak prevention" section
# and .githooks/pre-commit, which both depend on these three lines staying
# exactly as they are. Do not remove or narrow them.
PersonalKeywords.ahk
LocalPaths.ahk
AllScripts/PowerShell/ssd_config.json

# AI-assistant instructions - local-only, per this repo's own (gitignored)
# CLAUDE.md convention: project rules stay private even though they contain
# nothing sensitive by themselves.
CLAUDE.md

# Auto-generated HotkeyHelp.ahk runtime state (window-docking position,
# personal hotkey/file exclusion list) - regenerates itself on first use,
# meaningless on another machine's screen layout.
AllScripts/Hotkey Help.ini

# Local knowledge cache - condensed AHK reference notes, bug log, and
# community-solution pointers built up during AI-assisted work on this repo.
# Personal reference material, not project source - never pushed publicly.
Official Documentation/
Bugs/
Community-Solution/
